# Edge vhost for mp.virtastic.app — the openmw-mp multiplayer server. Deployed as a drop-in
# into the shared edge Caddy's sites dir (/opt/edge/sites/openmw-mp.caddy; imported by
# /opt/edge/Caddyfile via `import sites/*.caddy`), same pattern as morrowind.caddy.
#
# This origin serves only WebSocket upgrades (/ws) plus tiny JSON endpoints (/healthz, /status):
# - sec_headers is safe here (HSTS/nosniff/XFO only — no COOP/COEP, which must never be added
#   on this vhost; the game page's WebSocket connection is exempt from COEP embedding rules).
# - Caddy proxies WebSockets natively (Upgrade/Connection pass through); no `encode` — nothing
#   here benefits and it must not touch the WS stream.
# - No `import inject`: the server reads the real client IP from CF-Connecting-IP, which
#   Cloudflare sets and reverse_proxy forwards untouched. Only the edge can reach the container
#   (no published host ports), so the header is trustworthy.
mp.virtastic.app {
	tls /certs/virtastic.crt /certs/virtastic.key
	import sec_headers
	reverse_proxy openmw-mp:8080
}
